    "_convention": "One scene-spec JSON per script, saved alongside it as <script-name>.scenes.json. Each beat's `duration` is intentionally omitted here -- build_video.js fills it in at render time from the ACTUAL measured length of that beat's generated narration WAV. Germany (DE) and Poland (PL) are both real countries present in maps/country-codes.json, so this script uses the standard `highlight` convention for both at once."
